    "taxonomy_preservation": "Exactly 8 canonical states (S0..S7). Zero 9th states (no S8, no LSTM_UNAVAILABLE state).",
    "eligibility_contiguity_rule": "State transitions and dwell times are computed strictly across contiguous sequences of eligible windows. Ineligible windows terminate active sequences; zero transitions bridge across gaps."
